---
description: Operator cockpit architecture rules
globs:
  - web/backend/**
  - web/frontend/**
  - web/portal/**
  - web/deploy/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Read and enforce `docs/governance/projects/cockpit.md`.

The cockpit is a view-and-act surface over deterministic state. Auth,
authorization, every state mutation, approval actions and kill switches stay
deterministic. A cockpit action that mutates agent state must go through the
same script or module the agent uses — never a second write path.

Product panels inside the cockpit carry their own product's directive; check
`docs/governance/project-registry.yaml`.
